## Closed behavior of this Slice

Permanent generic state contracts:

- `GuardianWorkloadState`: `Unresolved / Offline / Desktop / Starting / Ready / Active / Ending`;
- `GuardianWorkloadStateConfidence`: `Unknown / Low / Medium / High`;
- `GenericGuardianWorkloadSignals`: explicit system-online, foreground, render-activity and recent-input signals;
- `GuardianWorkloadStateSnapshot`: exact stable identity/adapter context + existing `TelemetryWorkloadTarget`;
- `GenericGuardianWorkloadStateMachine`: stateful, Core-only, no side effects outside its transition memory.

Authority and transition rules:

- runtime target authority is reused from the existing `TelemetryWorkloadTargetResolver`;
- exact stable `GameId` remains separate from transient PID/path;
- unknown or duplicate stable identity fails closed to `Unresolved`;
- ambiguous running targets fail closed to `Unresolved` and never become actionable;
- `KnownExecutable`-only evidence never authorizes live state;
- a newly exact workload or changed PID enters `Starting`;
- the same exact process without sufficient active evidence settles at `Ready`;
- generic `Active` requires render activity plus foreground or recent-input evidence; this Slice invents no universal FPS threshold;
- losing the exact process after `Starting/Ready/Active` yields one conservative `Ending`, then `Desktop` if absence persists;
- explicit system offline yields `Offline` and removes stale live-process authorization from the returned target;
- `Reset()` clears transition memory;
- catalog/evidence inputs remain read-only;
- exact resolved `GameIdentity` and adapter references are preserved when identity is proven.

## Explicit non-scope

This Slice does **not** complete Track 6 item 1 by itself and does not implement Track 6 items 2–5.

It adds no discovery, startup scan, telemetry capture, universal classifier, dynamic baseline, mutation, canary, Profile authority, History persistence, Guardian Knowledge persistence, AppServices composition or WPF surface. Existing specialized BlueStacks/Free Fire Guardian files were left unchanged.

## Preserved invariants

- `Observed != Validated`.
- Missing capability/telemetry remains absent/Unknown.
- `KnownExecutable` never grants live capture/action.
- Global Controlled Benchmark Lease and Guardian suspend/reconcile remain untouched.
- Specialized FF/BlueStacks Guardian remains compatibility authority while the neutral path is introduced additively.
- UI remains presentation/request only.
- No anti-cheat/integrity bypass.

## Exact next action

Continue approved **Track 6 item 1 — generic workload state machine**, not Track 6 item 2 yet.

Before writing the next RED, inspect the current Windows/typed seams for foreground/window ownership, render/process telemetry and recent-input acquisition. Define the smallest explicit/on-demand observation bridge that can produce `GenericGuardianWorkloadSignals` for an already-selected stable `GameId` and exact resolved process without running discovery at startup or granting action authority.

Then repeat the canonical gate:

`docs/memory/context → bounded Slice design → TDD RED → exact intended RED → minimal production → verifier GREEN → selective official integration → exact Windows CI → memory/checkpoint sync → exact documentary-head CI`.